{"node_id": "nd001", "text": "feels positive", "depth": 0, "parent_id": null, "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.37496028427455336, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just been thinking about some stuff at work. It's all good though.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 80}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T043427Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T043427Z", "first_seen_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 1}
{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "To feel competent", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8, "confidence_raw": 0.8, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Just been thinking about some stuff at work", "char_start": 14, "char_end": 57}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "But I worked hard too, on some big projects.", "char_start": 124, "char_end": 168}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's just making me second-guess myself. I feel like maybe my efforts aren't enough or seen.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 92}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not sure why they gave my friend that promotion, though they did.", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Every time I see their success, it just makes me question my own worth.", "char_start": 29, "char_end": 100}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But I’ve been working just as hard, and I deserve some recognition too.", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 148}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It’s like every success they have feels like a reminder of what I’m missing.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 76}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, it's been frustrating.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I work just as hard, but it feels like my efforts don’t count as much.", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 108}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It's frustrating knowing I work just as hard but still feel overlooked.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 71}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "I can't shake off this feeling of not being valued", "char_start": 53, "char_end": 103}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "The workload has been insane, and every project feels like a race against time. It's hard to keep up and feel seen.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's hard to keep up and feel seen.", "char_start": 80, "char_end": 115}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Work feels overwhelming, and I can't shake off this feeling of not being valued.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 104}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "It makes me feel like maybe I'm not cut out for this, you know? Like, why am I working so hard if it doesn’t matter?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 116}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Sometimes I just feel stuck and unsure.", "char_start": 83, "char_end": 122}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Work feels like a competition sometimes.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 64}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's just... every time someone gets something I feel like I should have gotten, it makes me feel really jealous and unsure of myself.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 134}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I worked just as hard.", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 136}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "Like, last week my friend got a new job with a higher salary and I just felt... bitter. But I worked just as hard.", "char_start": 22, "char_end": 136}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T043427Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T045635Z", "first_seen_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "To express thoughts", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.7, "confidence_raw": 0.7, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just been thinking about some stuff at work. It's all good though.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just been thinking about some stuff at work.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 58}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Work has been tough lately. My friend got a new job with a higher salary, and it just... makes me feel... jealous, I guess.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 123}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "It's just hard when it feels like my efforts don't count. I work just as hard as others, if not harder, but it seems like no one sees it.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not sure why they gave my friend that promotion, though they did.", "char_start": 52, "char_end": 117}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things have been tough. Work stuff keeping me down.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 51}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Yeah, it's been frustrating.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 28}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "I appreciate the suggestion, but documenting my achievements sounds like more work.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 83}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's made me feel frustrated and like all my effort goes unnoticed.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 67}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "It just drains me, you know? I feel like I’m constantly fighting an uphill battle.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 82}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Work feels like a competition sometimes.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 64}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "It's just... every time someone gets something I feel like I should have gotten, it makes me feel really jealous and unsure of myself.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 134}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It affects my mood and how I interact with people. I start second-guessing myself and my efforts.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "Talking about it feels risky. What if they see I’m not as good as I pretend?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 76}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T043427Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T045550Z", "first_seen_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
{"node_id": "nd004", "text": "To maintain positive outlook", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.8, "confidence_raw": 0.8, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It's all good though.", "char_start": 59, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "How do you deal with those feelings?", "char_start": 93, "char_end": 129}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's just making me second-guess myself. I feel like maybe my efforts aren't enough or seen.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 92}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Yeah, thanks. Just been thinking about some stuff at work. It's all good though.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 80}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "I guess I just need to remind myself of all the hard work I do.", "char_start": 113, "char_end": 176}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "But I guess I just need to remind myself of all the hard work I do.", "char_start": 109, "char_end": 176}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "It feels like it's never enough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 32}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I guess it’s just part of the job.", "char_start": 68, "char_end": 106}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "It's just hard to stay positive when it feels like all my hard work is going unnoticed.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 87}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "It's made me feel frustrated and like all my effort goes unnoticed.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 67}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Work feels like a competition sometimes.", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 64}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Things have been tough.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But it's not fair to compare like that.", "char_start": 98, "char_end": 137}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "It affects my mood and how I interact with people. I start second-guessing myself and my efforts.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 97}, {"session_id": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "Sometimes it feels like focusing on myself is the only way to not feel behind. But it still feels unfair to compare, even if I try not to.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 138}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T043427Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T045635Z", "first_seen_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000398-sft_dec_gated_mem-s4", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 4}
